# Feralas (Horde) - Recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics, manuals and formulas whose
# SOURCE is physically in Feralas for a Horde buyer, verified against the
# local Forever game data (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables).
# Sixteen are vendor-sold by in-zone Horde vendors (Jangdor Swiftstrider,
# Bronk, and Sheendra Tallgrass at Camp Mojache, plus the neutral Zorbin
# Fandazzle — every buy carries an npc pin to the exact in-zone vendor);
# eleven are mob drops with sole in-zone droppers. Recipes sold only by
# Alliance vendors do not ship (Azure Silk Cloak and the two reagent bags
# are a genuine Horde gap — their sole vendor is Alliance). Everything else
# Feralas-dropping is a generic multi-zone world drop (Elwynn rule, argued
# per case in the inventory); quest records carry no reward data, so none
# of that class ships (see docs/feralas-horde-companions-inventory.md and
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Fishing has no Feralas
# Horde source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/feralas-horde-recipes
title Feralas (Horde) - Recipes
levels 38-50
zone Feralas
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords feralas, horde, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Leatherworking — Camp Mojache (Jangdor Swiftstrider)

  zone map 1444

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  tip Jangdor Swiftstrider (74.43, 42.91) at Camp Mojache sells the patterns; the shop is Horde, so Horde characters can buy.
  buy 7451 "Pattern: Green Whelp Bracers" npc 7854
  buy 8385 "Pattern: Turtle Scale Gloves" npc 7854
  buy 8409 "Pattern: Nightscape Shoulders" npc 7854
  buy 15734 "Pattern: Living Shoulders" npc 7854
  buy 252783 "Pattern: Rugged Armor Kit" npc 7854
  buy 252784 "Pattern: Rugged Armor Kit" npc 7854
  buy 252811 "Pattern: Rugged Armor Kit" npc 7854
  buy 252812 "Pattern: Rugged Armor Kit" npc 7854
  buy 252942 "Pattern: Rugged Armor Kit" npc 7854
  note Nightscape Shoulders and the five armor-kit patterns are sold ONLY by Jangdor — no Alliance source anywhere in the data. The duplicate Turtle Scale Gloves record (item 217271, same vendors) is deliberately not shipped; 8385 covers it. Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Alchemy — Camp Mojache (Bronk)

  zone map 1444

  when skill Alchemy 1

  tip Bronk (76.06, 43.28) at Camp Mojache sells both recipes; the shop is Horde, so Horde characters can buy.
  buy 6057 "Recipe: Nature Protection Potion" npc 8158
  buy 9302 "Recipe: Ghost Dye" npc 8158
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Cooking — Camp Mojache (Sheendra Tallgrass)

  zone map 1444

  when skill Cooking 1

  tip Sheendra Tallgrass (74.49, 42.73) at Camp Mojache sells all four recipes; the shop is Horde, so Horde characters can buy.
  buy 12229 "Recipe: Hot Wolf Ribs" npc 8145
  buy 13947 "Recipe: Lobster Stew" npc 8145
  buy 13948 "Recipe: Mightfish Steak" npc 8145
  buy 13949 "Recipe: Baked Salmon" npc 8145
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Engineering — the center (Zorbin Fandazzle)

  zone map 1444

  when skill Engineering 1

  tip Zorbin Fandazzle (44.81, 43.42) in central Feralas sells the schematic; the shop is neutral, so Horde characters can buy.
  buy 19027 "Schematic: Snake Burst Firework" npc 14637
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

