step Tailoring — the surveyor (rare drop)

  zone map 1444

  when skill Tailoring 1

  goto 91.9,49.0
  collect 254000 "Pattern: Earthen Leggings" optional
  note Dropped only by the Gravelsnout Surveyor (level 29) — below the core band, so trivial at Horde levels; sweep it opportunistically. The Surveyor also spawns in Thousand Needles; this is its Feralas point. The pattern drops nowhere else in the data.
  note Horde Tailoring has no vendor source in Feralas (Brienna Starglow's stock is Alliance-only) — these three drop patterns are the profession's whole in-zone source.

